    "text": "By Obituaries ,\n1 days ago July 27, 1937 - December 1, 2025 (age 88) Aldyth Ann Hales Stalder was born number seven in a family of eight children, on July 27th, 1937, to Heber Lee Hales Sr. and Lais Vernon. Her siblings Frances Mae Andersen, Weston Vernon Hales, Heber Lee Hales Jr., Lais Imogene Wilkinson, Clinton Dewitt Hales, Marjorie Daw Anderson and Dorthy Jane Mayhew. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
